{15}{I don't k-know, I think maybe it was an e-elf...a D-dark Elf.  The Curse, my friend, it's the Curse...why did I think I could escape it...?  [He looks at you, his face pale and drawn.  He is dying.]  What are YOU doing here...?}{I don't k-know, I think maybe it was an e-elf...a D-dark Elf.  The Curse, my friend, it's the Curse...why did I think I could escape it...?  [He looks at you, his face pale and drawn.  He is dying.]  What are YOU doing here...?}{}{}{}{}
