{21}{[Kendrick holds out his hand to you.]  Listen, friend...I don't have much time...the w-weapon used on me...I think it was magickal...I can feel the life leaving me even n-now.  [He closes his eyes, his teeth clenching against the pain.]  I am Elmer Burbottom...}{[Kendrick holds out his hand to you.]  Listen, friend...I don't have much time...the weapon used on me...I think it was magickal...I can feel the life leaving me even now.  [He closes his eyes, his teeth clenching against the pain.]  I am Elmer Burbottom...}{}{}{}{}
